#. Plugin Name of the plugin
msgid "Brew Log for Brewfather"
msgstr "Brew Log voor Brewfather"

#. Description of the plugin
msgid "Show your Brewfather recipes, batches and stock on your WordPress site."
msgstr "Toon je Brewfather-recepten, -batches en -voorraad op je WordPress-site."

#. Author of the plugin
msgid "MythoTec"
msgstr "MythoTec"

msgid "Brewfather is not set up yet. An administrator needs to enter the API credentials."
msgstr "Brewfather is nog niet ingesteld. Een beheerder moet de API-gegevens invullen."

msgid "Brewfather rejected the API credentials. An administrator needs to check them."
msgstr "Brewfather heeft de API-gegevens geweigerd. Een beheerder moet ze controleren."

msgid "This item could not be found in Brewfather."
msgstr "Dit item is niet gevonden in Brewfather."

msgid "Brewfather is busy right now. Please try again later."
msgstr "Brewfather is op dit moment druk. Probeer het later opnieuw."

msgid "Brewfather could not be reached. Please try again later."
msgstr "Brewfather is niet bereikbaar. Probeer het later opnieuw."

msgctxt "user role"
msgid "Brewer"
msgstr "Brouwer"

msgid "Brewfather account"
msgstr "Brewfather-account"

msgid "User ID"
msgstr "Gebruikers-ID"

msgid "API key"
msgstr "API-sleutel"

msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Instellingen"

msgid "You are not allowed to do this."
msgstr "Je hebt geen toestemming om dit te doen."

msgid "Test connection"
msgstr "Verbinding testen"

msgid "Connected to Brewfather."
msgstr "Verbonden met Brewfather."

msgid "Find your user ID and create an API key in Brewfather under Settings → API keys. The key needs the recipes.read, batches.read and inventory.read scopes."
msgstr "Je gebruikers-ID en een API-sleutel vind je in Brewfather onder Instellingen → API-sleutels. De sleutel heeft de scopes recipes.read, batches.read en inventory.read nodig."

msgid "A key is saved. Leave empty to keep it."
msgstr "Er is een sleutel opgeslagen. Laat dit veld leeg om die te behouden."

#, php-format
msgid "Connection failed: %s"
msgstr "Verbinding mislukt: %s"
